    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d572">

                <pb facs="1196" n="1164" xml:id="pg1164"/>

                <head>572. Telegram From the Embassy in Thailand to the Department of State<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d572-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Bangkok</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1960-11-27T10:00:00+07:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 27,
                                1960—10 a.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>905. Embassy telegram 856 and Department telegram 720.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d572-f2"/> In discussion Foreign Minister today he accepted as
                    satisfactory text proposed aide-mémoire contained Embassy telegram 856 as
                    modified by Department telegram 720. Minor editorial change to which I agreed
                    was beginning new paragraph at what is now third sentence second paragraph
                    prefaced by “Moreover”, so that sentence will read: “Moreover, the American
                    Ambassador also stated that as expressed in his letter to His Excellency the
                    Minister of Foreign Affairs etc.”.</p>
                <p>Unless otherwise instructed will deliver aide-mémoire early next week.<anchor
                        n="3" xml:id="d572-f3"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d572-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d572-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 611.92/11–2760. Top Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d572-f2" n="2" xml:id="d572-f2-content">
                <p><ref target="#d568">Document 568</ref> and <ref target="#d571"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">supra</hi></ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d572-f3" n="3" xml:id="d572-f3-content">
                <p>The Department concurred in the changes in telegram 751 to Bangkok, November 28.
                    (Department of State, Central Files, 611.92/11–2760)</p>
                <p>The aide-mémoire, dated December 1, was delivered to the Foreign Minister on the
                    following day. Johnson sent a copy to the Department in despatch 325 from
                    Bangkok, December 2. (<hi rendition="#italic">Ibid.</hi>, 792.5/12–260)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
